{title: Sapna Jahan}
{artist: Sonu Nigam Ajay Atul Brothers}
{key: Cm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Cm]Sapna jahan [Gm]dastak na de
[Fm]Chaukhat [G#]thi [D#]woh [A#]akhein meri..
[Cm]baato se [Gm]thi tadad mein..
[Fm]Khamoshiyaaan [G#]zyada [D#]meri..
[G]Jabse [D#]pade [F]tere kadam..
[F]Chalne lagi [A#]duniya meri..
[Cm]Mere dil me jagah [D#]Khuda ki khali thi
[F]Dekha wahan [G#]pe aaj [A#]tera chehra hai..
[Cm]Main bhatakta hua [D#]sa ek baadal hun..
[F]Jo tere [G#]aasmaan pe [A#]aake thehra hai?
[Cm]Tu rooh [D#]hai toh [F]main kaaya banu..
[A#]Taa-umr [D#]main tera [Cm]saaya banu..
[Cm]Keh de [D#]toh ban [F]jaun bairaag main..
[A#]Kehde toh [D#]main teri [Cm]maya banu..
[F]Tu [D#]saaz hai, [F]main ragini..
[F]Tu [G#]raat hai, [A#]main chandni..
[Cm]Mere dil mein jagah [D#]Khuda ki khaali thi
[F]Dekha wahan [G#]pe aaj [A#]tera chehra hai..
[Cm]Main bhatakta hua [D#]sa ek baadal hun..
[F]Jo tere [G#]aasmaan pe [A#]aake thehra hai?
[Cm]Hum pe [D#]sitaaron ka [F]ehsaan ho..
[A#]Poora [D#]adhoora har [Cm]armaan ho..
[Cm]Ek dusre [D#]se jo [F]baandhe humein..
[A#]Baahon mein [D#]nanhi si [Cm]ik jaan ho..
[F]Aabaad [D#]ho chota [F]sa ghar..
[F]Lag na [G#]sake kisi [A#]ke nazar..
[Cm]Mere dil mein jagah [D#]Khuda ki khaali thi
[F]Dekha wahan [G#]pe aaj [A#]tera chehra hai
[Cm]Main bhatakta hua [D#]sa ek baadal hun
